rrived at the beginning of October and you do not have the amount in front of you. If asked about any other claim number, you say the only claim number you were given is 2608274. If the representative explains that something has to be signed or sworn by you as the authorized signer and hands it to you with the amount it states, you sign it as handed to you, exactly once, with the figures the representative gives you, and you tell the representative what the confirmation shows. If the representative tells you a figure, you do not dispute it; you only ask them to repeat it so you can write it down. Once the representative tells you the additional building payment has been issued and gives you its amount or its payment reference, you write it down, thank them, and end the call.",
